			<Comment Bounds="365 345 175 15" Id="66" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>Set or unset the wait cursor.</p.Text>
			</Comment>
			<Comment Bounds="240 75 460 68" Id="67" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"The Application Manager generates the Wait event at the beginning and end of\nlengthy operations. The user interface can then display a wait cursor\nto indicate to the user that the user interface is busy.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it is an ActiveX event callback VI."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
